148CS5dL                                                                        
148CS5dL 2020Li32 adopted 151.1 ms {I12} which is 152 ms {I1} of 2017Li06.      
148CS5dL However 2017Li07 gave only the decay curve anf fit with no background, 
148CS5dL that is no much detail for a 0.7% precision.                           
148CS5dL                                                                        
148CS5dL Balraj also gives in XUNDL 158 ms {I7} (2000KoZH thesis, an earlier    
148CS5dL study at ISOLDE-CERN), but according to 2000KoZR "The half-lives and   
148CS5dL Pn values of 147,148Cs were taken from literature [Aud97]" (pag. 160)  
148CS2dL                                                                        
148CS2dL The reviewer of NN evaluation submitted in FY2023 did not retrieve the 
148CS2dL 170 ms {I7} (1980HaYY) in 1980HaYY but said this ref sends to          
148CS2dL "Azuma et al. that is to be published" which I did not find. As this   
148CS2dL value is an outlier I simply removed it from the w.a.                  

