148LA  H TYP=FUL$AUT=N. NICA$CIT=NDS 208, 1 (2026)$CUT=17-Jan-2026$             
148LA c  1984Ch02: used 90 cm{+3} Ge(Li) detector with FWHM(1332 keV)=1.9 keV,  
148LA2c  76 cm{+3} Ge coaxial detector with FWHM(1332 keV)=1.7 keV, and         
148LA2c  5 cm{+3} Ge planar detector with FWHM(122 keV)=0.55 keV.               
148LA2c  Measured: E|g, I|g, Ice, |g|g coin, |g|g(t) coin, T{-1/2}, K| x ray.   
148LA2c  The E|g values are reported with double-digit precision, of which,     
148LA2c  however, many differ by 3|s or more from the values calculated from    
148LA2c  the energy difference of initial and final levels (as calculated from  
148LA2c  a least-squares fit to E|g data) as commented in Adopted Levels, Gammas
148LA2c  dataset.                                                               
148LA c  The level scheme is incomplete                                         
148LA cB $I|b|?0 (1984Ch02)                                                     
