148ER cG $ The |g anistropy information was extracted from projected spectra    
148ER2cG recorded at 79|', 101|' and 143|' relative to the beam direction. The  
148ER3cG assignments of levels spins was based mostly on these anistropies,     
148ER4cG defined as asymmetry ratio R=2I|g(143|')/[I|g(79|'+101|')]. Expected   
148ER5cG average values are 1.4 for |DJ=2, quadrupole and 0.7 for |DJ=1, dipole.
148ER6cG The |DJ=0, dipole transitions have nearly the same ratio as for        
148ER7cG |DJ=2, quadrupole, as judged from listed values in contents of table 3 
148ER8cG of 2001Ro15                                                            
148ER cG RI(A)$Unresolved structure. Intensity and DCO ratios are combined      
